  "releaseNotes": "⭐ Last 10 features:\n- feat: add .NET 10 targets while retaining supported frameworks 2026-10-10\n- feat: Updated to NET9 and added trimming/NativeAOT support. 2024-12-06\n- feat: Use same versions for all packages. 2024-10-21\n- feat: Added MessagePackFormatter<T1> to H.Formatters.MessagePack lib. 2024-01-20\n- feat: Added PipeClient.CreatePipeStreamForConnectionFunc. 2023-12-08\n- feat: Updated versioning. 2023-12-08\n- feat: Added support for WriteOnly PipeServer. 2023-12-08\n- feat: Added PipeServer.CreatePipeStreamForConnectionFunc. 2023-12-08\n- feat: Use MessagePackFormatter by default on net8.0. 2023-11-27\n- feat: Update to net8.0. 2023-11-27\n🐞 Last 10 bug fixes:\n- fix: close connected pipes before joining canceled readers 2026-10-12\n- fix: await listener completion before releasing worker resources 2026-10-12\n- Merge pull request #162 from JaseRandall/fix/inferno-key-exchange-event-subscription 2026-10-12\n- Merge branch 'master' into fix/inferno-key-exchange-event-subscription 2026-10-10\n- Merge branch 'master' into fix/inferno-key-exchange-event-subscription 2026-10-10\n- fix: publish through repository OIDC identity 2026-09-13\n- Merge pull request #149 from HavenDV/codex/fix-raw-server-ready-test 2026-06-27\n- Merge pull request #148 from HavenDV/codex/fix-single-raw-test-ci 2026-06-27\n- Merge pull request #147 from HavenDV/codex/fix-non-generic-pipe-ci 2026-06-27\n- fix: Removed net6/net7. 2024-10-19",
